# DS-0002 (image runs as root): accepted for tests/images/ubuntu/Dockerfile only.
# That image simulates a virtual machine for Molecule and the lab, systemd must be PID 1,
# and it is never deployed. Any other Dockerfile added here must run as a non-root user.
DS-0002

# DS-0026 (no HEALTHCHECK): accepted for tests/images/ubuntu/Dockerfile only.
# Molecule and the lab manage the container lifecycle, and `systemctl is-system-running`
# usually reports "degraded" in a container, so a health check would mark a working host as unhealthy.
DS-0026
